  "articleBody": "Considering an attached ADU for your Los Angeles home? It's a fantastic way to add living space, whether for family, guests, or even rental income. But before you get too excited about the design possibilities, there are some fundamental things you'll want to understand. Attached ADUs come with their own unique set of considerations that can impact your existing home and property.",
